  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INDEPTH is an international network currently consisting of 33 demographic surveillance system (DSS) field sites in 19 dev countries that collectively monitor over 2 Million people at a household-level. The vision of INDEPTH is to harness the collective potential of these DSS to provide a better, empirical understanding of health and social issues, and to apply this understanding to alleviate health problems.</narrative>
  </description>
